OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fand cloudy this evening, with rain
OL,7,Freaching the Western Isles near
OL,8,Fmidnight. Heavy rain then spreads east
OL,9,Fovernight. Strong southeasterly winds
OL,10,Fbring coastal gales or severe gales.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy with heavy rain at
OL,13,Ffirst. Rain clearing eastwards by
OL,14,Fmidday to leave a largely dry
OL,15,Fafternoon with long sunny spells
OL,16,Fdeveloping. Breezy with strong winds
OL,17,Fover the Western Isles.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
