OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells with a few showers on Thursday,
OL,7,Fcloudier with rain spreading east
OL,8,Fovernight. Mostly cloudy Friday with
OL,9,Frain or showers. Sunny spells and
OL,10,Fshowers Saturday. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
